# Terraform downloads and local backend settings
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfstate.d/
tfplan
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
*.plan
*.plan.*
plan.out
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

